<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Consorcio Ara initiated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Consorcio Ara initiated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear, Stearns &amp; Co Sobani Warner and Daniel Altman on Thursday started coverage of Mexican construction company Consorcio Ara SA de CV with a rating of attractive.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We estimate substantial growth in all areas of its business in 1997, as the company continues to take and consolidate newly won market share,&quot; they wrote in a report.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
